    "detailed_description": "<strong>Synopsis</strong><br>In order to protect the peace of the cats, you (the cat) have been ordered to retrieve the gold nuggets from the evil dog.<br>Throw koban to punish the bad dog, retrieve the gold nuggets placed in the buildings, and escape in a balloon!<br>Sneak into various buildings and use gimmicks and equipment to accomplish your mission!<br>You (the cat) are the only one who can restore peace to the cats!<br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>The game is a side-scrolling 3D action game. You can move forward, backward, left and right, jump, and throw gold (koban).<br>The purpose of this work is for players to collect gold nuggets and clear all stages within the time limit.<br><br><strong>Game features</strong><br>\u30fbCollect gold nuggets and escape. Please enjoy the gestures of cute cats.<br>\u30fbThere are 10 stages. There is a high difficulty mode.<br>\u30fb You can buy items at the shop with cat food that can be picked up in the game. It can be strengthened with a cat, so you can easily capture it.<br>\u30fbThere is an additional mode to change the player character.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Synopsis</strong><br>In order to protect the peace of the cats, you (the cat) have been ordered to retrieve the gold nuggets from the evil dog.<br>Throw koban to punish the bad dog, retrieve the gold nuggets placed in the buildings, and escape in a balloon!<br>Sneak into various buildings and use gimmicks and equipment to accomplish your mission!<br>You (the cat) are the only one who can restore peace to the cats!<br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>The game is a side-scrolling 3D action game. You can move forward, backward, left and right, jump, and throw gold (koban).<br>The purpose of this work is for players to collect gold nuggets and clear all stages within the time limit.<br><br><strong>Game features</strong><br>\u30fbCollect gold nuggets and escape. Please enjoy the gestures of cute cats.<br>\u30fbThere are 10 stages. There is a high difficulty mode.<br>\u30fb You can buy items at the shop with cat food that can be picked up in the game. It can be strengthened with a cat, so you can easily capture it.<br>\u30fbThere is an additional mode to change the player character.",
